# Root routing for the static-assets deploy.
#
# wrangler.jsonc sets html_handling:"none", which matches request paths to
# files exactly — no implicit index. That is what keeps every internal link a
# direct 200 instead of a 307, but it also means "/" matches no file and falls
# through to not_found_handling. These two lines are what give the bare domain
# something to serve.
#
# Cloudflare excludes this file from the assets it serves; it is config, not a page.

/            /home.html   302
/index.html  /home.html   301
